# Line endings are pinned here, not left to each contributor's core.autocrlf.
#
# Without this file the working tree's endings depend on a local Git setting: a clone with
# autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, one without checks out LF, and whichever contributor differs
# eventually commits the other form. The result is a whole-file diff that reviews as "everything
# changed", which defeats the read-the-full-diff-cold step in docs/mvp-scope.md §12.
#
# LF everywhere, in the repository and in the working tree, matching .prettierrc.json's
# endOfLine: "lf" so `npm run format:check` agrees on Windows and on CI.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never transform, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
